---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import Guide from './Guide.astro';
---

<Guide
  id="motif"
  title="The node graph"
  intro="Labeled nodes, wired ports, and edges that leave each port straight before they curve. The graph appears only where it explains how something works."
>
  <figure class="m-0 min-w-0 max-w-full">
    <div class="max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-media border border-line">
      <div class="stage grid-canvas">
        <svg class="stage-edges" width="600" height="240" viewBox="0 0 600 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path class="edge" data-state="active" d="M174 64 C 207 64 207 172 240 172" />
          <path class="edge" d="M390 172 C 408 172 408 64 426 64" />
        </svg>
        <div class="node absolute h-16 w-[150px]" style="left: 24px; top: 32px;" data-state="done">
          <div class="node-bar">campaign-brief <Icon name="ph:check" size={14} class="node-check ml-auto" aria-hidden="true" /></div>
          <div class="node-body">Spring-2026</div>
          <span class="port" data-side="out"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="node absolute h-16 w-[150px]" style="left: 240px; top: 140px;" data-state="active">
          <div class="node-bar">render</div>
          <div class="node-body">8 / 320 tiles</div>
          <span class="port" data-side="in"></span>
          <span class="port" data-side="out"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="node absolute h-16 w-[150px]" style="left: 426px; top: 32px;">
          <div class="node-bar">library</div>
          <div class="node-body">queued</div>
          <span class="port" data-side="in"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="stage-packet" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2">
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-line"></span> idle edge</span>
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-active"></span> active edge</span>
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-done"></span> done node</span>
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-packet"></span> packet</span>
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-port"></span> port</span>
      <span class="legend"><span class="key key-grid"></span> canvas grid, 24px pitch</span>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
    <ul class="rules">
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Node</strong>: card radius, 1.5px border, minimum 160x56 on desktop. Mono title bar on surface with a bottom hairline. Idle border is line; active is graphic-deep plus shadow-raised; done is graphic with a 14px check in the bar.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Port</strong>: 8px circle centered on the border edge (offset <code class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem]">var(--port-off)</code>), white fill, 1.5px graphic-deep stroke. A port exists only where an edge attaches.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Edge</strong>: cubic bezier with horizontal tangents: exit right, enter left (or exit bottom, enter top). 1.5px stroke. Edges never cross and never loop.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Packet</strong>: 6px graphic-deep dot with a 2px white ring, linear travel, one per active edge, staggered 600ms. Packets only move; a packet at rest is a bug.</li>
    </ul>
    <ul class="rules">
      <li>The dot-grid canvas appears only behind genuine graph surfaces: hero graph, pipeline stage, footer sitemap, closing band. Never as texture elsewhere.</li>
      <li>Maximum six nodes per graph outside the pipeline demo.</li>
      <li>Every node label is real production vocabulary (persona names, pipeline steps, the file naming convention). No lorem nodes.</li>
      <li>Mono stays on graph surfaces and captions; it never leaks into prose.</li>
      <li>No gradients, glows, or neon on wires. State shows through stroke color and the check mark.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Guide>

<style>
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 600px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    height: 240px;
  }
  .stage-edges {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .node-body {
    padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .stage-packet {
    position: absolute;
    left: -3px;
    top: -3px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-graphic-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-white);
    offset-path: path('M174 64 C 207 64 207 172 240 172');
    offset-rotate: 0deg;
    animation: motif-packet 2.4s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes motif-packet {
    0% { offset-distance: 0%; opacity: 0; }
    12% { opacity: 1; }
    88% { opacity: 1; }
    100% { offset-distance: 100%; opacity: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .stage-packet { display: none; }
  }
  .legend {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--color-dash-ink);
  }
  .key { display: inline-block; }
  .key-line { width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--color-line); }
  .key-active { width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--color-graphic-deep); }
  .key-done { width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--color-graphic); }
  .key-packet {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-graphic-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-white), 0 0 0 3px var(--color-line);
  }
  .key-port {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--color-graphic-deep);
  }
  .key-grid {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--color-grid) 1.5px, transparent 1.6px);
    background-size: 7px 7px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .rules {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    list-style: disc;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
